#. module: stock_mrp_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_mrp_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__done_mrp_lot_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Custom ZPL II label for lot/SN printing when a manufacturing order is done. "
"Used when the product does not define its own ZPL label template. When a "
"custom ZPL label is selected, the official IoT printing method is replaced "
"by direct ZPL II printing to the configured printer."
msgstr ""
"生产单完成时用于批次／序列号打印的自定义 ZPL II 标签。当产品未定义自己的 ZPL 标签模板时使用。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方 IoT "
"打印方式将被替换为直接向已配置打印机发送 ZPL II 打印。"

#. module: stock_mrp_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_mrp_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__generated_mrp_lot_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Custom ZPL II label for lot/SN printing when a new lot/SN is generated. When"
" a custom ZPL label is selected, the official IoT printing method is "
"replaced by direct ZPL II printing to the configured printer."
msgstr ""
"新生成批次／序列号时用于批次／序列号打印的自定义 ZPL II 标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向已配置打印机发送"
" ZPL II 打印。"

#. module: stock_mrp_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_mrp_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__lot_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Default ZPL II label for lot/SN printing. Used when the product does not "
"define its own ZPL label template. When a custom ZPL label is selected, the "
"official IoT printing method is replaced by direct ZPL II printing to the "
"configured printer."
msgstr ""
"用于批次／序列号打印的默认 ZPL II 标签。当产品未定义自己的 ZPL 标签模板时使用。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方 IoT "
"打印方式将被替换为直接向已配置打印机发送 ZPL II 打印。"

#. module: stock_mrp_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_mrp_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__package_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Default ZPL II label for package printing. When a custom ZPL label is "
"selected, the official IoT printing method is replaced by direct ZPL II "
"printing to the configured printer."
msgstr ""
"用于包装打印的默认 ZPL II 标签。选择自定义 ZPL 标签后，官方 IoT 打印方式将被替换为直接向已配置打印机发送 ZPL II 打印。"

#. module: stock_mrp_auto_print
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_mrp_auto_print.field_stock_picking_type__product_zpl2_label_id
msgid ""
"Default ZPL II label for product printing. Used as a fallback when neither "
"the product nor the scenario-specific (lot/done/generated) ZPL label is "
"configured."
msgstr "用于产品打印的默认 ZPL II 标签。当产品与场景专用（批次／已完成／新建）ZPL 标签均未配置时作为回退使用。"

